      "content": "thanks. those are good points for the episode. but i also want to address the pushback. like, how would you describe the arguments tech companies use to block these laws? i want to make sure i'm not being unfair, but it usually feels like they're just making excuses to keep us dependent on them. how do their actual legal arguments look?",
